      "navigation": [],
      "en": "Expense tracking is not offered in this portal. **Expenses** is not listed in the sidebar, and opening the Expenses page directly shows a not-found page, whatever your role. The sidebar's finance entries are **Payments**, **Invoices** and **Fines**; managers see only the ones they have been granted. TRAX cannot add, edit or delete expenses, and it cannot make the Expenses tracker available.",
      "ur-Latn": "Is portal mein expense tracking available nahi hai. Sidebar mein **Expenses** nahi hai, aur Expenses page seedha kholne par not-found page aata hai, chahe aap ki role koi bhi ho. Sidebar mein finance ke liye **Payments**, **Invoices** aur **Fines** hain; managers ko sirf woh dikhte hain jin ki unhein ijazat mili ho. TRAX expenses add, edit ya delete nahi karta, aur Expenses tracker ko available bhi nahi kar sakta."
